			"bonus": 599,
			"iconPers": "Dopglava_razboy",
			"description": "I should put a knife to your gullet and have a rummage in your heroic supplies! I think I might find a couple of interesting things... Only joking, if I touched you, I might end up in the grave myself. Anyway, I am in your debt - if it wasn't for you, those demons would have given me a right going over. My former mates! This is a complicated business. And you're not just here by chance, I have a nose for these things. Get revenge on whoever it was turned my boys into the living dead. They were freaks before, but it's not right to treat them like that, that's not the robbers' way of doing things. And I will give you this little trinket - with it and your strength, you will be able to crack any skull.",
