			"bonus": 661,
			"iconPers": "glava3_NPC",
			"description": "Who is there? A human? Another miserable human? Cursed tribe - there is no getting away from you. You are never satisfied, you can never stop... You destroy whatever you touch! Look what you have turned our caves into! It used to be peaceful and calm here, but now! I will squash you for this, like a miserable Kwaagwa! \nHmmm... It seems you are different from the others... You want to make everything right? Perhaps I will let you live. Your death will not change anything anyway! I will even help you: take this artifact, it will come in useful in the fight against evil which is taking you to the east.",
