			"bonus": 662,
			"iconPers": "glava4_NPC",
			"description": "Happy to see you, great warrior! May your name be honored forever for liberating our Branendal from the possessed! I am the senior Inquisitor, one of the few left alive. Most of us died fighting the great demon. Far in the east, in the land of the dead beyond the sands of the desert, he has broken free. The best of our warriors stood in his path and were completely destroyed. The demon took possession of their souls and they returned to Branendal, killing everybody that got in their way. You were able to defeat these possessed ones, so you are stronger than us and you have a chance against Sovering himself. Take these combat elixirs, they will help you in the fight against the demon.",
