			"bonus": 663,
			"iconPers": "glava5_NPC",
			"description": "I am the eternal Crystal of Reason. For a thousand years I have watched your foolishness, and this is the first time I have thanked a human. Thank you for your help, short-lived creature! Some ancient magic enslaved my children, who you call Crystallides. My obedient offspring have stopped listening to me. Some unknown force has subjugated them and is trying muddle my clear, strong mind. You need to be as strong as iron to withstand it. I see that your spirit is strong, but that is not enough for victory. Take these artifacts, may they strengthen your will and improve your magical skills.",
