			},
			"bonus": 610,
			"iconPers": "Dopglava_dub",
			"description": "I have heard about you in Branendal - it is a great joy for us that you managed to free the city. Now I can deal with the wounded there, which is why I risked coming to this oak. A brew from its acorns would put the dead back on their feet.\nBut if it wasn't for you, no brew would have saved me. To kill all those beasts single-handedly! I am amazed at your bravery! The only thing better than courage, is armed courage. The senior Inquisitor ordered me to give you something, when he learned that I was going to the oak. This is the legendary weapon of one of our rulers. For many years it was gathering dust in our treasury, and now it again has a worthy owner, take it!",
