			"bonus": 664,
			"iconPers": "glava6_NPC",
			"description": "Thank you, oh great blade! Truly, you can be compared with the gods! Legends will be told about you, our children and grandchildren will sing about your bravery! Your arrival was forecast by our seer: a hero will come from the west in a blaze of glory. His path will lie further to the east, through the territory of the Zvergs to the land of the dead. The fate of the world depends on his sword, and his opponent will be an ancient evil. Some Masks awoke this evil. We should help the great hero, the seer said, so please accept these magical elixirs.",
