			"bonus": 608,
			"iconPers": "Dopglava_oazis",
			"description": "I swear to you, menace of the demons. Your sword has again opened the way to the only spring in this desert! The spirit of the sands Sherhergora guarded this oasis for a long time. For some reason he became angry with us and started to kill everybody that approached the water. I know that you were going east, and you had no need to fight Sherhergora. But you decided to save us, and now we will not die a terrible death from thirst!\nAs a sign of our gratitude, I ask you to accept this ancient armor. When I was a child, a prophetic dream revealed to me where it lay, covered with sand. A long time ago, when this desert was a blossoming garden, another great warrior, a demigod in strength, fought in this armor against the Devourers, defending the human race - just like you. In the same prophetic dream I was told that I should save the armor until a hero appeared to give water to the desert. This day has come, and I give the armor to you.",
